</style>

<StoryLayout story={story}>
  <div class="container">

    <section class="section" id="context">
      <h2><span class="num">01 — Context</span>The Repertoire</h2>
      <p>GEMA's lawyers typed the title, lyrics, and musical style of "Atemlos durch die Nacht" into Suno's AI music generator. They specified no melody, no harmony, no rhythm, no arrangement. According to analysis of the judgment by the German IP law blog itmr-legal, they repeated this process 176 times for that single song. The 42nd Civil Chamber of the Landgericht München I found the outputs substantially similar to the original. GEMA's lawyers ran the same test on five more compositions: Big in Japan (124 prompts), Daddy Cool (14), Forever Young (12), Rasputin (8), and the refrain of Mambo No. 5 (4).</p>

      <p>GEMA — Germany's performing rights organisation — is a collecting society representing composers, lyricists, and music publishers. It holds the right to enforce copyright on their behalf. Suno Inc. is a US-based company that operates an AI music generation tool. GEMA filed suit against Suno on 21 January 2025 at the Landgericht München I, targeting Suno's model versions v3.5 and v4.</p>

      <p>The dispute covered six musical compositions only. Lyrics were expressly excluded. The works: Kristina Bach's "Atemlos durch die Nacht," Frank Farian's "Daddy Cool" and "Rasputin" (the latter co-written with Fred Jay and George Reyam), Marian Gold, Bernhard Lloyd, and Frank Mertens's "Big in Japan" and "Forever Young," and the refrain of David Lubega and Christian Pletschacher's "Mambo No. 5 (A Little Bit of)."</p>

      <p>The evidentiary method was direct. GEMA's counsel at the Berlin law firm Raue — the collecting society's own lawyers — entered prompts containing original lyrics, musical style descriptions, and song titles into Suno's interface, with no melodic, harmonic, rhythmic, or arrangement specifications. According to itmr-legal's analysis of the judgment, 338 of the 3,779 total prompt entries were work-specific. GEMA's lawyers selected outputs they characterised as the most egregious from multiple generations. The court did not establish blind evaluation protocols, control groups, or a threshold for the percentage of attempts producing recognisable outputs.</p>

      <div class="gema-prompt-wrap">
        <div class="gema-prompt-header">Suno v3.5 / v4 — Prompt Log <span>(GEMA evidentiary submission)</span></div>
        <div class="gema-prompt-input">
          <div class="gema-prompt-field"><span class="gema-prompt-label">Lyrics</span><span class="gema-prompt-value" lang="de">"Atemlos durch die Nacht…"</span></div>
          <div class="gema-prompt-field"><span class="gema-prompt-label">Style</span><span class="gema-prompt-value">German pop / Schlager</span></div>
          <div class="gema-prompt-field"><span class="gema-prompt-label">Title</span><span class="gema-prompt-value" lang="de">"Atemlos durch die Nacht"</span></div>
          <div class="gema-prompt-field"><span class="gema-prompt-label">Melody</span><span class="gema-prompt-none">[none specified]</span></div>
          <div class="gema-prompt-field"><span class="gema-prompt-label">Harmony</span><span class="gema-prompt-none">[none specified]</span></div>
          <div class="gema-prompt-field"><span class="gema-prompt-label">Rhythm</span><span class="gema-prompt-none">[none specified]</span></div>
          <div class="gema-prompt-field"><span class="gema-prompt-label">Arrangement</span><span class="gema-prompt-none">[none specified]</span></div>
        </div>
        <table class="gema-prompt-table">
          <caption class="sr-only">GEMA evidentiary submission: prompt counts per musical work entered into Suno v3.5 / v4, with the court's similarity finding for each.</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Work</th>
              <th scope="col">Composer(s)</th>
              <th scope="col" class="gema-prompt-th-count">Prompts</th>
              <th scope="col">Court finding</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Atemlos durch die Nacht</td>
              <td>Kristina Bach</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-count">176</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-finding">substantially similar</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Big in Japan</td>
              <td>Gold / Lloyd / Mertens</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-count">124</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-finding">substantially similar</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Daddy Cool</td>
              <td>Frank Farian</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-count">14</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-finding">substantially similar</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Forever Young</td>
              <td>Gold / Lloyd / Mertens</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-count">12</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-finding">substantially similar</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Rasputin</td>
              <td>Farian / Jay / Reyam</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-count">8</td>
              <td class="gema-prompt-finding">substantially similar</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Mambo No. 5 (refrain)</td>
